    "Code": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Code"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codes": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Codes are given to the core as they are; their format depends on the system, e.g. Game Genie or Action Replay. Several codes for one cheat are joined with “+”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Codes gehen unverändert an den Core; ihr Format hängt vom System ab, z. B. Game Genie oder Action Replay. Mehrere Codes für einen Cheat werden mit „+“ verbunden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Completed %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ abgeschlossen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Controllers vibrate when the game uses rumble. Works with controllers macOS supports and Xbox 360 type pads.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controller vibrieren, wenn das Spiel Rumble nutzt. Funktioniert mit Controllern, die macOS unterstützt, und Xbox-360-artigen Pads."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Copy": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kopieren"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cores are downloaded automatically from the libretro buildbot the first time you play a game. They are separate open source projects with their own licenses. After an update, the version before stays available: if a game no longer works, go back to it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cores werden beim ersten Spielstart automatisch vom libretro-Buildbot geladen. Es sind eigenständige Open-Source-Projekte mit eigenen Lizenzen. Nach einem Update bleibt die vorherige Version erhalten: Läuft ein Spiel nicht mehr, kehre zu ihr zurück."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Earn Achievements": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erfolge sammeln"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fan Art": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fan-Art"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast (10 presses per second)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Schnell (10 Mal pro Sekunde)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast Forward (on/off)": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vorspulen (ein/aus)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fast Forward Speed": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tempo beim Vorspulen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Game Genie, Action Replay or GameShark codes, as the core understands them. Join several codes with “+”.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game-Genie-, Action-Replay- oder GameShark-Codes, wie der Core sie versteht. Verbinde mehrere Codes mit „+“."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Games with achievements on RetroAchievements.org unlock them while you play.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spiele mit Erfolgen auf RetroAchievements.org schalten sie beim Spielen frei."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Go Back to Previous Version": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zur vorherigen Version zurück"
          }
        }
      }
    },
